"""
5G-PacketSense Integrated - Unified packet analysis and live capture system.

This is the main Flask application that serves as the backend for the
5G-PacketSense platform. It provides:

- REST API endpoints for PCAP file upload, analysis, and querying
- WebSocket-based real-time packet streaming via Flask-SocketIO
- Live packet capture using Scapy (requires admin/root privileges)
- Switch monitoring mode for enterprise VPN detection
- Multi-layer VPN detection (keyword, ASN, IP database, API)
- GeoIP-based packet flow visualization data
- DuckDB-powered SQL analytics on Parquet-formatted packet data

Usage:
    python app.py                          # Start web server on port 5000
    python app.py data/parquet/file.parquet # Pre-load a parquet file

Requirements:
    - Python 3.8+
    - Admin/root privileges for live capture
    - Npcap (Windows) or libpcap (Linux/macOS) for packet capture

See README.md for full setup and usage instructions.
"""

